{"id":"7f2ee867f14428e3","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-semantic.md","title":"GL Semantic","display":"df-gl-semantic — GL Semantic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-semantic","aliases":["89-df-gl-semantic"],"display":"df-gl-semantic — GL Semantic","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-semantic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-semantic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-semantic — GL Semantic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> is a set of Kripke models\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\">\\(M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> are fixed by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a> and\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是下述定义的模型—公式关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为系统下标，模型集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为其参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}semantic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle M,A\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\land\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W_M,R_M))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall w\\in W_{M}\\;(M,w\\models A)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}semantic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle M,A\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\land\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W_M,R_M))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall w\\in W_{M}\\;(M,w\\models A)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL语义通过 Kripke 模型定义</li>\n<li>语义关系只定义“在哪些 GL 模型上有效”；GL 的可靠性仍需定理证明。</li>\n<li>集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 避免把所有集合大小模型的真类伪装成集合。</li>\n<li>GL语义是 GL 完全性的基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U$ is a set of Kripke models\n$M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)$ (see [[89-df-kripke-model]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}$ and $\\models$ are fixed by [[89-df-gl-frame]] and\n[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}$ and $\\models$ are fixed by [[89-df-gl-frame]] and\n[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}semantic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\langle M,A\\rangle\\in\\mathcal U\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&M=(W_M,R_M,V_M)\\land\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W_M,R_M))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall w\\in W_{M}\\;(M,w\\models A)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":1350,"backlinks":[{"id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3a52f6ccd0a0a127","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal U$ is a set of GL Kripke models and\n$\\mathrm{Sem}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\mathcal U)$ is the relation from\n[[89-df-gl-semantic]]."},{"id":"c0adaf80b9cae9e6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-semantic]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","ab746eb779e20ce0","9f00301866fbd6f0","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}